EPIC-THIRD-BATCH EPIC-COMPLETION

All 48 catalogue feats are implemented. Use FEATS INFO <name> for the full
Study description. New active commands: epic psi-contingency, sentinel-mind,
eidolon-intercession, adaptive-aspect, spell-opportunity, spell-stowaway, recover.
These subcommands follow the word EPIC. Timers use real seconds offline.
Opportunity reservations expire on reconnect without refund. Older conditions
without saved original DC metadata cannot be selected for Epic Heroic Recovery.
Native Resist Energy protects against all native energy types.
